= Bolesław Drobner

Drobner enters the adviser pool in 1928. He represents Lewica PPS and focuses on political negotiation with KPP.

**Planned, not implemented:** Joint Workers' Action requires a dedicated cooperation state. It will not merge KPP, trade-union or PPS militia manpower.

- @negotiate_kpp
